            "text": "For a standard 2BHK flat (700–950 sq.ft) in Kharghar, modular woodwork ranges from ₹2.8 Lakhs to ₹4.0 Lakhs, while a complete turnkey interior (including false ceiling, painting, electrical rewiring, and modular furniture) ranges from ₹5.5 Lakhs to ₹8.0 Lakhs."
