            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "An IS:710 BWP Marine Plywood modular kitchen in Kharghar costs between ₹1.5 Lakhs to ₹2.5 Lakhs for an L-shape layout and ₹2.2 Lakhs to ₹3.5 Lakhs for parallel or island configurations with German soft-close fittings."
          }
        }
