          Most design firms in Navi Mumbai act as aggregators or consultants who subcontract the actual carpentry to outside third-party carpenters, adding 20% to 30% in middleman commissions. At Siddhivinayak Designers, we own an automated German CNC manufacturing plant in Navi Mumbai. By building directly in our factory, Kharghar homeowners get wholesale material rates, 100% genuine IS:710 Marine Plywood, and an itemized locked-BOQ with zero surprise charges.
